codex
The transcripts show the failure mode clearly: models independently discovered the global-XOR complement and returned verified witnesses; adding equations only gave them more substitutions. A separate near-cap trial at 56 bits was also solved by the first available oracle, so I’m doing one final 58-bit/288-XOR check—the largest cap-compliant instance—to distinguish a true ceiling from an under-escalated ladder.
