The exact generator/checker passes all local gates, but the bare oracle loop solved every tested level and ended `budget_bound`. The naïve rank-one quantization idea was also ruled out by the paper’s easy-case results and Section 4.3 experiments. Accordingly, I did not claim hardness or emit artifacts. See the [paper](https://arxiv.org/html/1706.00078v1).

