The paper’s simple planted quantized rank-one family is easy by its Section 2/4 results. The retained construction instead uses its Section 3 reduction. Exact GF(2) elimination needs about 47,782 measured bit operations, while the structural route needs 288 XORs. Increasing size further breaches the 300-operation cap, producing the required `cap_bound` disposition. The configured harness exposed only two oracle models rather than the specified four-vendor pool; this is documented as a caveat. [Paper](https://arxiv.org/abs/1706.00078).
